cab6b78ab140"],

Cell["We\[CloseCurlyQuote]re going to try to fit this generalized Pareto \
function:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8330896248049726`*^9, 3.8330896405320787`*^9}, 
   3.8330897283044558`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a8202a82-8ab5-400a-83ed-\
